<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Delivery approvals · D’ RAW</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/warehouse-ui.css"><style>body{margin:0;padding:20px;background:#fff4e8;color:#220b4a;font:16px system-ui}main{max-width:1400px;margin:auto}button,input,select{font:inherit;padding:12px;border:1px solid #d9c8ec;border-radius:10px}button{background:#35116c;color:white;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5}article,section.card{background:white;border:1px solid #dfd2eb;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;margin:16px 0}.warning{background:#fff0ed;color:#9c202b;padding:14px;border-radius:10px}.count{background:#ba1831;color:white;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:24px;display:inline-block}.row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{text-align:left;padding:12px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}td input{max-width:140px}.changed{background:#fff4dc}.muted{color:#6e6082}summary{cursor:pointer;padding:10px}a{color:#35116c}dialog{border:0;border-radius:14px;max-width:90vw}button.secondary{background:#eee3f7;color:#35116c}.table-wrap{overflow:auto}#message:empty{display:none}</style></head><body><main><a href="/workspaces">← Workspaces</a><h1>Delivery corrections & approvals</h1><p>Review delivery corrections, instruction suggestions, product requests and driver-reported problems. Clean verified deliveries are approved automatically.</p><div class="row"><strong id="count" class="count">Loading approvals…</strong><button id="refresh">Refresh</button><label>Find route, customer or invoice <input id="search" type="search"></label><label><input id="all" type="checkbox"> Include approved</label></div><p id="message" role="status"></p><div id="queue"></div></main><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/office-approvals.js"></script><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/office-notification.js"></script></body></html>